From da76300755f055dbe74b325912c08cdd92ffc207 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "v.oleynikov" <vasily.oleynikov@flant.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 08:24:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] do not require an ALT jre package

OpenJDK 11 is imported into the image from container-base
(openjdk-11.0.31), so no jre package is installed and the rpm
dependency cannot be satisfied. OpenJDK ships its own tzdb.dat,
so tzdata-java is not needed either.

Signed-off-by: v.oleynikov <vasily.oleynikov@flant.com>
---
 linstor.spec | 7 +++----
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/linstor.spec b/linstor.spec
index cf465ae..f7a51ae 100644
--- a/linstor.spec
+++ b/linstor.spec
@@ -71,9 +71,9 @@ cp %{_builddir}/%{NAME_VERS}/docs/linstor.toml-example %{buildroot}/%{_sysconfdi
 %package common
 Summary: Common files shared between controller and satellite
 Group: System Environment/Daemons
-Requires: jre-11-headless
-## This should really be included in the jre-headless dependencies, but it isn't.
-Requires: tzdata-java
+## No JRE requirement: the image imports OpenJDK 11 from container-base
+## (openjdk-11.0.31) instead of installing an ALT jre package, and OpenJDK
+## ships its own tzdb.dat, so tzdata-java is not needed either.
 
 %description common
 Linstor shared components between linstor-controller and linstor-satellite
@@ -92,7 +92,6 @@ Linstor shared components between linstor-controller and linstor-satellite
 Summary: Linstor controller specific files
 Group: System Environment/Daemons
 Requires: linstor-common = %{version}
-Requires(post): jre-11-headless
 
 %description controller
 Linstor controller manages linstor satellites and persistant data storage.
-- 
